BT /F2 14 Tf 54 686 Td (1. Project Overview) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 659 Td (This project implements a local Text-to-SQL assistant for the Chinook Music Store SQLite) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 646 Td (database. The user asks a natural-language question in a Gradio interface. The system builds) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 633 Td (live schema context from SQLite metadata, sends the question and schema to a local Ollama) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 620 Td (model through LangChain, validates the generated SQL, executes only safe read-only queries,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 607 Td (and returns the generated SQL, explanation, result table, and status.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 586 Td (The project uses:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 66 565 Td (- Gradio for the UI.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 66 552 Td (- LangChain LCEL for the Text-to-SQL pipeline.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 66 539 Td (- Ollama with llama3.1:8b as the local LLM.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 66 526 Td (- SQLite for the Chinook database.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 66 513 Td (- Pandas for query results.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 66 500 Td (- sqlparse plus custom validation for safety checks.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 479 Td (Conversation memory for follow-up questions is intentionally not implemented in this) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 466 Td (version.) Tj ET
BT /F2 14 Tf 54 437 Td (2. Architecture Diagram) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 64 410 Td (User question) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 64 397 Td (  -> Gradio Blocks UI) Tj ET
