BT /F1 10 Tf 54 144 Td (and validation rules:) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54 115 Td (Aggregating at the wrong grain) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 91 Td (For questions such as customers spending more than the average in their country, the model) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 78 Td (may compare individual invoice rows instead of first summing spending per customer. The fix) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 65 Td (is a general rule: aggregate detail rows at the requested entity grain before comparing) Tj ET
