BT /F2 9 Tf 54 765 Td (Text-to-SQL Assistant Report) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 520 30 Td (Page 4) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 734 Td (totals, averages, maximums, minimums, or ranks.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54 705 Td (Missing requested metrics) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 681 Td (For questions asking for both revenue and sold count, the model may return only one metric.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 668 Td (The prompt now instructs the model to calculate and return every requested metric) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 655 Td (explicitly.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54 626 Td (Top item per group) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 602 Td (For questions such as the top revenue-generating artist in each country, the model may) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 589 Td (produce invalid alias or subquery references. The prompt and repair prompt now recommend a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 576 Td (CTE with ROW_NUMBER\(\) OVER \(PARTITION BY group ORDER BY metric DESC/ASC\) and filtering to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 563 Td (row number 1.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54 534 Td (Optional related data) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 510 Td (For questions including support representatives or optional related entities, an inner join) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 497 Td (can hide rows with missing related records. The prompt now recommends LEFT JOIN and COALESCE) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 484 Td (where optional information may be missing.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54 455 Td (Schema hallucination) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 431 Td (The model can still propose table or column names that do not exist. This is mitigated by) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 418 Td (live schema context, strict prompt rules, and schema_validator.py.) Tj ET
BT /F2 14 Tf 54 389 Td (6. Technical Challenges) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 66 362 Td (- Local LLM output can be inconsistent, so the engine must parse and validate model) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 66 349 Td (  output defensively.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 66 336 Td (- Complex analytical questions require the model to choose the correct result grain) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 66 323 Td (  before writing SQL.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 66 310 Td (- SQLite date and ranking logic requires specific syntax such as strftime and window) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 66 297 Td (  functions.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 66 284 Td (- SQL safety must be enforced outside the LLM because prompt instructions alone are not) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 66 271 Td (  enough.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 66 258 Td (- Schema validation is useful but remains a practical checker, not a complete SQL) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 66 245 Td (  parser.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 66 232 Td (- The app depends on a local Ollama server and the configured model being available.) Tj ET
BT /F2 14 Tf 54 203 Td (7. Improvements Made) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 66 176 Td (- Added user-input validation before model invocation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 66 163 Td (- Added SQL safety validation before database execution.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 66 150 Td (- Added schema-aware validation for table and column references.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 66 137 Td (- Added a general SQL repair step.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 66 124 Td (- Strengthened prompt rules for grouped analytics, averages, rankings, requested) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 66 111 Td (  metrics, alias scope, and optional joins.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 66 98 Td (- Added automatic database download when Chinook_Sqlite.sqlite is missing.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 66 85 Td (- Updated README setup instructions.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 66 72 Td (- Added a PDF report artifact.) Tj ET
endstream
